IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q02-ATM-WITHDRAWAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BALANCE         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-WITHDRAWAL      PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-REMAINDER       PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-QUOTIENT        PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-NEW-BAL         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-BAL        PIC Z(8)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-BALANCE
ACCEPT WS-WITHDRAWAL
IF WS-BALANCE < 0 OR WS-WITHDRAWAL <= 0
    DISPLAY "INVALID AMOUNT"
ELSE
    IF WS-WITHDRAWAL > WS-BALANCE
        DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS"
    ELSE
        DIVIDE WS-WITHDRAWAL BY 100 GIVING WS-QUOTIENT REMAINDER WS-REMAINDER
        IF WS-REMAINDER NOT = 0
            DISPLAY "DENOMINATION ERROR"
        ELSE
            COMPUTE WS-NEW-BAL = WS-BALANCE - WS-WITHDRAWAL
            MOVE WS-NEW-BAL TO WS-DISP-BAL
            DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-BAL)
        END-IF
    END-IF
END-IF
STOP RUN.
